---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout
  title="Cleaning & Restoration Services | BamaClean North Alabama"
  description="Carpet cleaning, tile & grout cleaning, upholstery, water damage restoration, mold inspection & fire damage cleanup across North Alabama. Free quotes. (256) 324-0492."
  canonical="/services/"
>

  <!-- Page Hero -->
  <section style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0F1B2D 0%,#1A2A42 100%);color:#fff;padding:72px 24px;text-align:center;">
    <div style="max-width:700px;margin:0 auto;">
      <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#22C55E;margin-bottom:12px;">What We Offer</p>
      <h1 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;margin-bottom:16px;">Our Services</h1>
      <p style="font-size:1.0625rem;color:rgba(255,255,255,.8);line-height:1.7;">Professional cleaning and restoration services for homes and businesses across North Alabama. Call <a href="tel:+12563240492" style="color:#22C55E;font-weight:700;">(256) 324-0492</a> for a free estimate.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Carpet Cleaning -->
  <section id="carpet" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#fff;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 01</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Carpet Cleaning</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Our truck-mounted hot-water extraction system delivers the deepest clean available — removing embedded dirt, allergens, pet dander, bacteria, and stubborn stains that regular vacuuming can't reach.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">Most carpets are dry in 6–10 hours. We use family-safe, eco-friendly solutions that are safe for kids and pets. Residential and commercial carpet cleaning available throughout North Alabama.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;">
            <span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Deep hot-water extraction cleaning
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;">
            <span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Pet odor & stain removal
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;">
            <span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Allergen reduction
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;">
            <span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Residential & commercial
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;">
            <span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Area rug cleaning
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B7A3D;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Get a Quote</a>
          <a href="/services/carpet-cleaning/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#1B7A3D;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#E8F5EC;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🧹</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">Truck-Mounted Hot Water Extraction</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">The gold standard for carpet cleaning — more powerful than portable units, leaving carpets cleaner and drying faster.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tile & Grout -->
  <section id="tile" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#F1F5F9;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;order:1;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🔲</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">High-Pressure Steam Cleaning</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">Our specialized rotary cleaning system reaches deep into grout lines to remove years of buildup — no scrubbing required.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="order:2;">
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 02</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Tile & Grout Cleaning</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Tile looks great when new, but grout lines absorb dirt and grime over time — turning dingy and discolored. Our high-pressure rotary steam cleaning system restores tile and grout to like-new condition without harsh chemicals.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">We clean kitchen tile, bathroom tile, shower tile, floor tile, and commercial tile surfaces. Grout sealing available to protect your results longer.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Kitchen & bathroom tile</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Shower & floor tile</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Deep grout line cleaning</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Grout sealing available</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Commercial tile cleaning</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B7A3D;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Get a Quote</a>
          <a href="/services/tile-grout-cleaning/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#1B7A3D;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Upholstery -->
  <section id="upholstery" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#fff;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 03</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Upholstery Cleaning</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Your sofas, chairs, and fabric surfaces collect dust, allergens, pet hair, and odors over time. Our professional upholstery cleaning safely removes dirt and stains without damaging delicate fabrics.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">We clean all types of upholstery — microfiber, cotton, linen, velvet, and more. We test each fabric type before treatment to ensure the safest, most effective approach.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Sofas, loveseats & sectionals</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Dining chairs & ottomans</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Pet odor & stain removal</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Allergen reduction</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> All fabric types</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B7A3D;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Get a Quote</a>
          <a href="/services/upholstery-cleaning/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#1B7A3D;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#E8F5EC;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🛋️</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">Fabric-Safe Cleaning</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">Every fabric is tested before treatment. We use the right method for each material — protecting your furniture while delivering a deep clean.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Water Damage -->
  <section id="water" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#FEF2F2;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;order:1;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">💧</div>
        <div style="background:#DC2626;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.875rem;padding:8px 20px;border-radius:100px;display:inline-block;margin-bottom:16px;">24/7 Emergency Response</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">Call Now: (256) 324-0492</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">Water damage doesn't wait. Neither do we. Fast response across all of North Alabama.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="order:2;">
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#DC2626;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 04 · Emergency</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Water Damage Restoration</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">When flooding, burst pipes, or leaks strike, every minute counts. BamaClean provides 24/7 emergency water damage extraction, structural drying, and full restoration services across North Alabama.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">Our IICRC-certified technicians use industrial extraction equipment and commercial dehumidifiers to remove water fast — minimizing damage and preventing mold growth before it starts.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">✓</span> 24/7 emergency response</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Water extraction & removal</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Structural drying & dehumidification</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Mold prevention</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#DC2626;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Insurance documentation assistance</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="tel:+12563240492" style="display:inline-block;background:#DC2626;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Call 24/7: (256) 324-0492</a>
          <a href="/services/water-flood-damage/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#DC2626;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #DC2626;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Mold -->
  <section id="mold" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#fff;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div>
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 05</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Mold Inspection & Removal</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Mold is a serious health hazard and can spread quickly through your home. BamaClean provides professional mold inspection, air quality testing, and certified mold remediation throughout North Alabama.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">Our certified mold specialists identify the source of moisture, test air quality, contain the affected areas, and safely remove mold — leaving your home safe and healthy.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Mold inspection & testing</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Air quality sampling</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Certified mold remediation</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Moisture source identification</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Post-remediation verification</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B7A3D;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Schedule Inspection</a>
          <a href="/services/mold-inspection/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#1B7A3D;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#E8F5EC;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🔬</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">Certified Mold Specialists</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">Our certified team identifies, contains, and removes mold safely — then verifies the results so you can breathe easy.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Fire Damage -->
  <section id="fire" style="padding:80px 24px;background:#F1F5F9;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fit,minmax(300px,1fr));gap:48px;align-items:center;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:20px;padding:48px;text-align:center;order:1;">
        <div style="font-size:5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🔥</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.25rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:8px;">Full Restoration Services</h3>
        <p style="color:#475569;font-size:.9375rem;">From soot removal to odor elimination and structural drying — we handle the complete fire damage cleanup process.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="order:2;">
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">Service 06</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:20px;">Fire & Smoke Damage Cleanup</h2>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:16px;">Fire and smoke damage can be devastating, leaving behind soot, char, and persistent odors that penetrate walls, carpets, and furnishings. BamaClean provides comprehensive fire and smoke damage cleanup and restoration.</p>
        <p style="color:#475569;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:24px;">We work efficiently to salvage as much as possible, eliminate smoke odors, clean soot-damaged surfaces, and restore your home or business to its pre-loss condition.</p>
        <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px;margin-bottom:32px;">
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Soot & smoke removal</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Odor elimination</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Contents cleaning & restoration</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Structural cleaning</li>
          <li style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;font-size:.9375rem;color:#334155;"><span style="color:#1B7A3D;font-weight:700;">✓</span> Insurance claim support</li>
        </ul>
        <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
          <a href="/contact" style="display:inline-block;background:#1B7A3D;color:#fff;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;">Get a Quote</a>
          <a href="/services/fire-smoke-damage/" style="display:inline-block;background:transparent;color:#1B7A3D;font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;padding:14px 32px;border-radius:100px;border:2px solid #1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Additional Services Grid -->
  <section style="padding:80px 24px;background:#fff;">
    <div style="max-width:1280px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:56px;">
        <p style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:.8125rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:#1B7A3D;margin-bottom:10px;">More Services</p>
        <h2 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:clamp(1.5rem,3vw,2.25rem);font-weight:800;color:#0F1B2D;">Additional Specialty Services</h2>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(280px,1fr));gap:24px;">
        <div style="background:#F8FAFB;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;">
          <div style="font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🧶</div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:10px;">Area Rug Cleaning</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.9375rem;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px;">Fiber-specific cleaning for wool, Persian, silk, and synthetic rugs. Pickup and delivery available.</p>
          <a href="/services/area-rug-cleaning/" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:#1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#F8FAFB;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;">
          <div style="font-size:2.5rem;margin-bottom:16px;">🔬</div>
          <h3 style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-size:1.125rem;font-weight:700;color:#0F1B2D;margin-bottom:10px;">Radon Testing</h3>
          <p style="font-size:.9375rem;color:#475569;line-height:1.6;margin-bottom:20px;">EPA-protocol radon testing with written reports. North Alabama's only cleaning company offering this service.</p>
          <a href="/services/radon-testing/" style="font-family:'Plus Jakarta Sans',sans-serif;font-weight:700;font-size:.9375rem;color:#1B7A3D;">Learn More →</a>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#F8FAFB;border:1px solid #E2E8F0;border-radius:16px;padding:32px;">
